{
  "uid": "scidirector-overview",
  "title": "SciDirector · 生成链路",
  "tags": ["scidirector"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "服务",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
        "query": { "type": "serviceName" },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "怎么用这块看板",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**验收对象**：跑一次生成请求，然后在下面的表格里按 `service` 筛出一棵树。\n\n- 一次请求应当同时出现 **三个服务**的 span：`scid-api`（HTTP 入口）→ `scid-worker`（消费任务）→ `scidirector-ai`（图节点）。\n- 只有一段说明**链路在中间断了**：去 `worker/tracing.go` 看 `traceparent` 是否随队列载荷传过去。\n- 点任一行的 Trace ID 可以在 Tempo 的 Trace 视图里看瀑布图与各段耗时。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "最近的链路（跨服务）",
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" }",
          "limit": 40,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP 请求量（按路径）",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP 请求延迟 P95",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Go 运行时：goroutine 数 / 堆内存",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "go_goroutines", "legendFormat": "goroutines" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "go_memstats_heap_inuse_bytes / 1024 / 1024", "legendFormat": "heap inuse (MB)" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "各服务 span 速率（每秒）",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "来自 Tempo 的 span 指标（metrics_generator）。为空说明 Tempo 尚未生成指标，属正常——需要先有流量。"
    }
  ]
}
